        {"source": "spec", "quote": "Temperature sensor | NAVCPeripherals | TMP100, I2C addr 0x4E"}
      ],
      "impact": "The temperature sensor will only answer at 0x4F, so firmware that expects it at 0x4E will not detect it (temperature data missing / I2C probe failure).",
      "confidence": 0.4
    }
  ],
  "summary": "A likely address-pin error was found on the TMP100 temperature sensor: both address pins are tied high (0x4F), while the specification and the schematic note both call for 0x4E, so the sensor would not be found at its intended address."
}

